{
    "title": "New Orleans Saints Mobile",
    "description": "This is the New Orleans Saints' official mobile app. You can use it to keep up with breaking team news, watch live interviews, dive into advanced gameday stats, manage your game tickets with ease plus much more!\r\n \r\n\u2028\u2028Features include:\r\n- News: Real-time breaking news from the Saints, previews of upcoming matchups, post-game blogs\r\n- Video: Video-on-demand clips of the Saints' press conferences, coach and player interviews\r\n- Photos: Gallery of game-time action\r\n- Audio: Podcasts \r\n- Stats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats of the matchup, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box score, out-of-town scores around the league\r\n- Standings: Division and conference standings\r\n- Fantasy: Keep track of your favorite fantasy players\r\n- Depth chart: Shown by offense, defense and special teams\r\n- Social media: Aggregated twitter of the Saints' official tweets, check in to the stadium on game-day, one-click tweet of all media items, one-click facebook posting of all media items\r\n- Schedule: Schedule of upcoming games, and scores/stats of previous games from the season, ticket purchase for games\r\n- Evolving home-screen: Pre-game, in-game, post-game, off-season countdown, draft-day\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen's proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html  for more information. \r\n\r\nFollow us @saints on Twitter for updates or visit www.saints.com.\r\n\r\nFollow us @yinzcam on Twitter for updates or to ask questions and provide feedback.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is the New Orleans Saints&#39; official mobile app. You can use it to keep up with breaking team news, watch live interviews, dive into advanced gameday stats, manage your game tickets with ease plus much more!<br> <br>\u2028\u2028Features include:<br>- News: Real-time breaking news from the Saints, previews of upcoming matchups, post-game blogs<br>- Video: Video-on-demand clips of the Saints&#39; press conferences, coach and player interviews<br>- Photos: Gallery of game-time action<br>- Audio: Podcasts <br>- Stats: Real-time statistics and scores from the official NFL stats engine, head-to-head stats of the matchup, player stats, drive-by-drive stats, box score, out-of-town scores around the league<br>- Standings: Division and conference standings<br>- Fantasy: Keep track of your favorite fantasy players<br>- Depth chart: Shown by offense, defense and special teams<br>- Social media: Aggregated twitter of the Saints&#39; official tweets, check in to the stadium on game-day, one-click tweet of all media items, one-click facebook posting of all media items<br>- Schedule: Schedule of upcoming games, and scores/stats of previous games from the season, ticket purchase for games<br>- Evolving home-screen: Pre-game, in-game, post-game, off-season countdown, draft-day<br><br>Please note: This app features Nielsen&#39;s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen&#39;s TV Ratings. Please see https://priv-policy.imrworldwide.com/priv/mobile/us/en/optout.html  for more information. <br><br>Follow us @saints on Twitter for updates or visit www.saints.com.<br><br>Follow us @yinzcam on Twitter for updates or to ask questions and provide feedback.",
